			"notes": "Updated to [Minecraft 1.21.4](https://minecraft.wiki/w/Java_Edition_1.21.4) (requires Java 21).\n    \n* Rewrote mixins for `PlayerEnterPortal` & `PlayerCompleteAdvancement` callbacks to be compatible with Minecraft 1.21.4.\n* Fixed exceptions thrown by unsafe `Optional.get()` calls on `Advancement.display` / `AdvancementFrame` properties.\n* Stopped logging advancements that wouldn't be announced in chat."
		},
